{
  "question_type": "single_choice",
  "stem_md": "曲线 $x=e^{2t},y=\\ln t,z=t^2$ 在 $t=2$ 对应点处的切线方程是。",
  "options_json": [
    {
      "key": "opt_1",
      "content_md": "$\\frac{x-e^4}{e^4}=\\frac{y+\\frac12-\\ln2}{1/2}=\\frac z4$"
    },
    {
      "key": "opt_2",
      "content_md": "$\\frac{x-e^4}{2e^4}=\\frac{y-\\ln2}{1}=\\frac{z-4}{4}$"
    },
    {
      "key": "opt_3",
      "content_md": "$\\frac{x-e^4}{2e^4}=\\frac{y-\\ln2}{1/2}=\\frac{z-4}{4}$"
    },
    {
      "key": "opt_4",
      "content_md": "$\\frac{x-e^4}{2e^4}=\\frac{y-\\ln2}{1/2}=\\frac{z-4}{2}$"
    }
  ],
  "answer_json": {
    "option_keys": [
      "opt_3"
    ]
  },
  "analysis_md": "因 $x|_{t=2}=e^4$，$y|_{t=2}=\\ln 2$，$z|_{t=2}=4$，又 $x'|_{t=2}=2e^{2t}=2e^4$，$y'|_{t=2}=\\frac{1}{t}=\\frac{1}{2}$，$z'|_{t=2}=2t=4$，则切线方程为：\n\n$$\\frac{x-e^4}{2e^4}=\\frac{y-\\ln 2}{\\frac{1}{2}}=\\frac{z-4}{4}.$$",
  "search_text": "曲线 $x=e^{2t},y=\\ln t,z=t^2$ 在 $t=2$ 对应点处的切线方程是。 $\\frac{x-e^4}{e^4}=\\frac{y+\\frac12-\\ln2}{1/2}=\\frac z4$ $\\frac{x-e^4}{2e^4}=\\frac{y-\\ln2}{1}=\\frac{z-4}{4}$ $\\frac{x-e^4}{2e^4}=\\frac{y-\\ln2}{1/2}=\\frac{z-4}{4}$ $\\frac{x-e^4}{2e^4}=\\frac{y-\\ln2}{1/2}=\\frac{z-4}{2}$ 因 $x|_{t=2}=e^4$，$y|_{t=2}=\\ln 2$，$z|_{t=2}=4$，又 $x'|_{t=2}=2e^{2t}=2e^4$，$y'|_{t=2}=\\frac{1}{t}=\\frac{1}{2}$，$z'|_{t=2}=2t=4$，则切线方程为：\n\n$$\\frac{x-e^4}{2e^4}=\\frac{y-\\ln 2}{\\frac{1}{2}}=\\frac{z-4}{4}.$$",
